LoCoMo Refined makes benchmark-specific modifications on top of the
upstream release, including:

- correcting a subset of inaccurate or low-quality questions
- refining benchmark data used for public evaluation
- updating and tuning the judge / evaluator behavior for more stable
  scoring
- restructuring the runnable evaluation package for standalone use

